# Symbols nothing can reach, kept deliberately. Format: <symbol> <reason>
#
# An entry without a reason is indistinguishable from an oversight, and a stale
# entry reads as permission for something that is no longer there — the gate
# rejects both.
#
# Currently empty. The three entries that lived here were the outbound webhook
# delivery path — implemented, HMAC-signed, retrying, auto-disabling after ten
# failures, and unreachable because no event source called it. It is now the
# third transport behind the notification dispatcher, so it has one.
